 "questions": [
  {
   "id": 242673,
   "is_answer_order_important": true,
   "stimulus_html": "<figure class=\"unnumbered\">\n<img src=\"exercises/media/24ea1e7fbbbb6bd9.jpg\" alt=\"\">\n<figcaption>(credit: modification of work by Thomas Chowns/National Council for Air and Stream Improvement)</figcaption>\n</figure>\n",
   "stem_html": "<p>The graph shows the results of a research study involving pepper plants. The pepper plants have ant colonies living in them. The ants eat caterpillars which eat the leaves of the pepper plants.</p>\n<p>The researchers introduced some beetles to some of the pepper plants. The beetles ate the ants, reducing their numbers. Then the researchers collected data on the leaf surface area of the trees with beetles introduced and trees which did not have beetles.</p>\n<p>Make a claim about this research.</p>",
   "answers": [
    {
     "id": 760153,
     "content_html": "The ants and the beetles are in a mutualistic relationship."
    },
    {
     "id": 760152,
     "content_html": "The beetles and the caterpillars are in a mutualistic relationship."
    },
    {
     "id": 760151,
     "content_html": "The beetles and the pepper trees are in a mutualistic relationship."
    },
    {
     "id": 760154,
     "content_html": "The ants and the pepper trees are in a mutualistic relationship."
    }
   ],
